        "original_id": "edb0c989-a613-56d0-b7a6-f554e0f9991f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: YG Entertainment\n- People: Nakjoon\n- Groups: Jinusean, JTL, Epik High\n- Products: The Reign, Verse 2, 0817\n- Charts: Billboard World Albums Chart\n\nFacts:\n- Nakjoon debuted under YG Entertainment in 1995 as a member of the duo Jinusean.\n- YG Entertainment formed Epik High as a group.\n- Epik High released the record \"Verse 2.\"\n- JTL debuted as a seven-member group.\n- JTL released the EP \"The Reign.\"\n- \"The Reign\" peaked at number one on the Billboard World Albums Chart.\n- Nakjoon was later a member of JTL.\n- JTL released the record \"0817.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
