        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "0fe3fd02-582d-5a17-8a3c-70797b2ce69f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: JB, Jinyoung, Mark, Jackson, Youngjae, BamBam, Yugyeom, Bernard Park, NakJoon\n- Companies: JYP Entertainment\n- Groups: JJ Project, Got7\n- Products: \"Bounce\", \"Got It?\", \"Verse 2\"\n- Topics: South Korean pop music, K-pop debuts\n\nFacts:\n- JJ Project is a South Korean pop duo consisting of JB and Jinyoung.\n- JJ Project was formed by JYP Entertainment and released its first single, \"Bounce,\" in May 2012.\n- Bernard Park, professionally known as NakJoon, was born on January 29, 1993, and is an American singer based in South Korea who debuted under JYP Entertainment.\n- Got7 is a South Korean boy group formed by JYP Entertainment.\n- Got7 consists of seven members: JB, Mark, Jackson, Jinyoung, Youngjae, BamBam, and Yugyeom.\n- Got7 debuted in January 2014 with its first EP, \"Got It?,\" which reached number two on the Gaon Album Chart and number one on Billboard's World Albums Chart.\n- \"Verse 2\" is the first extended play by the South Korean male duo JJ Project.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "92268743-27cf-590d-ba84-94be75a9307b",
        "text": "Page: JJ Project. Sentence: JJ Project (Korean: 제이제이 프로젝트 ) is a South Korean pop duo, consisting of JB and Jinyoung.\nPage: JJ Project. Sentence: They were formed by JYP Entertainment and released their first single \"Bounce\" in May 2012.\nPage: Got7. Sentence: Got7 () is a South Korean boy group formed by JYP Entertainment.\nPage: Got7. Sentence: The group is composed of seven members: JB, Mark, Jackson, Jinyoung, Youngjae, BamBam, and Yugyeom.\nPage: Got7. Sentence: Got7 debuted in January 2014 with the release of their first EP \"Got It?\nPage: Got7. Sentence: \", which peaked at number two on the Gaon Album Chart and number one on \"Billboard's\" World Albums Chart.\nPage: Verse 2. Sentence: Verse 2 is the first extended play by South Korean male duo JJ Project.\nPage: Nakjoon. Sentence: Bernard Park (born January 29, 1993), known professionally as NakJoon, is an American singer based in South Korea who debuted under JYP Entertainment.",
